# Feedback past 1 (P2 255): a click every two bars starts the tape oscillating; the saturator holds it near -6 dBFS while P1 is
# swept for a dub siren (glides within an octave, crossfades beyond). Echoes only (pan 255).
tempo 120
steps 96
tail 1
track fx1
input impulse 32 0.5
param p1 100
param p2 255
param pan 255
param level 255
gain 1
sweep p1 100 80 32 48
sweep p1 80 120 48 64
sweep p1 120 40 72 96
expect sound 8 96
expect peak_below -5.5
